PaiCLI Python

This Python implementation follows the coding-agent concepts studied in PaiCLI
and the author's independently implemented Java FlowTrail CLI:
https://github.com/cloudwallker/flowtrail-cli
Reference revision: 845ae7c5266f45dba16d0cc32a5c2d5da3122b82

The Python source was written for this repository with AI coding assistance.
It is a focused implementation, not a line-by-line port or a claim of feature
parity. The inherited MIT license and original contributor notice are retained.
The README explicitly separates lexical retrieval and application-level path
policies from vector retrieval and operating-system sandboxing.

Runtime dependencies are installed separately and retain their own licenses.
No Java distribution, dependency binaries, personal data or credentials are
included in this source repository.
